{"title": "Additional Spell Slot", "pageid": 28305, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Additional_Spell_Slot", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Additional Spell Slot</b> is a passive feature that gives you an extra spell slot.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain 1 <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Devotion\" title=\"Shield of Devotion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Devotion\" title=\"Shield of Devotion\">Shield of Devotion</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_the_Undevout\" title=\"Shield of the Undevout\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_the_Undevout\" title=\"Shield of the Undevout\">Shield of the Undevout</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Additional Spell Slot can grant an extra spell slot once <i>per character</i> per long rest, despite the Spell Slot Depleted condition on the item.</li>\n<li>Additional Spell Slot can grant an extra spell slot multiple times to the same character if that spell slot is used to create a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/30px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/40px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Point</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195935\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1299/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13722/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3495/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 154/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1043634/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.221      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   43.221      1 -total\n 41.42%   17.900      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 35.97%   15.548      2 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 33.30%   14.391      2 Template:MdRarit